##Authority=bcftools 1.23.1 silently substitutes "." for the interior empty element ("XD=1,,2" -> "XD=1,.,2"), no warning, exit 0 -- confirmed live via bcftools view on 2026-08-15, matching BcftoolsDependencyTest#testInfoValueInteriorEmptyElementBcftoolsSubstitutesDot (that test declares the reserved key AD with Number=3; this fixture uses the non-reserved test key XD instead, to avoid an unrelated "INFO AD has Number '3' but the reserved definition expects 'R'" warning from this library's own reserved-INFO-arity check confounding this fixture's own citation below -- bcftools's behavior on the empty entry itself is unaffected by this key choice, confirmed live).
##Authority=vcf_validator 0.10.2 reports this file invalid: "Line 11: INFO XD does not match the meta specification Type=Integer. XD=1,,2." -- measured live via vcf_validator -i <file> -r summary,text on 2026-08-15.
